              <h3>Education & Certifications</h3>
              <div class="cv-education">
                <div class="cv-edu-item">
                  <h4>Bachelor of Computer Science (Honours)</h4>
                  <p>Carleton University &mdash; September 1999 - May 2003</p>
                  <p>Honours Project: <a href="https://paulabrams.ca/hga4tsp">A Hierarchical Genetic Algorithm for the Traveling Salesman Problem</a></p>
                  <img src="/assets/degree800x600.jpg" alt="Bachelor of Computer Science degree" class="cv-degree-image" loading="lazy" />
                </div>
                <div class="cv-edu-item">
                  <h4>Professional Scrum Master I (PSM I)</h4>
                  <p>Scrum.org &mdash; September 2025</p>
                  <p><a href="https://scrum.org/certificates/1250586" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verify Certification</a> | <a href="/assets/Professional Scrum Master I.pdf" target="_blank">View Certificate</a></p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
